5,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjI5MzM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15229335?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS","html_url":"https://github.com/JekaS178RUS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-09-02T18:40:24Z","updated_at":"2018-09-02T18:40:24Z","body":"I think this issue should be reopened. Even with new API aiCreateAndRegisterDefaultMaterial STL loader overwrite any parameters setted previously for that material, which is pointless.\r\n\r\nOnly usefull usage of aiCreateAndRegisterDefaultMaterial is a way to detect if material is default. But not to use your own parameters.\r\n\r\nAll because of this peace of code from STLLoader.cpp:\r\n```\r\n   // create a single default material, using a white diffuse color for consistency with\r\n    // other geometric types (e.g., PLY).\r\n    aiMaterial* pcMat = aiCreateAndRegisterDefaultMaterial();\r\n    /*aiMaterial* pcMat = new aiMaterial();\r\n    aiString s;\r\n    s.Set(AI_DEFAULT_MATERIAL_NAME);\r\n    pcMat->AddProperty(&s, AI_MATKEY_NAME);*/\r\n\r\n    aiColor4D clrDiffuse(ai_real(1.0),ai_real(1.0),ai_real(1.0),ai_real(1.0));\r\n    if (bMatClr) {\r\n        clrDiffuse = clrColorDefault;\r\n    }\r\n    pcMat->AddProperty(&clrDiffuse,1,AI_MATKEY_COLOR_DIFFUSE);\r\n    pcMat->AddProperty(&clrDiffuse,1,AI_MATKEY_COLOR_SPECULAR);\r\n    clrDiffuse = aiColor4D( ai_real(1.0), ai_real(1.0), ai_real(1.0), ai_real(1.0));\r\n    pcMat->AddProperty(&clrDiffuse,1,AI_MATKEY_COLOR_AMBIENT);\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/comments/417950828/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"JekaS178RUS","id":15229335,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjI5MzM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15229335?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS","html_url":"https://github.com/JekaS178RUS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekaS178RUS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/comments/461851363","html_url":"https://github.com/assimp/assimp/issues/2059#issuecomment-461851363","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/2059","id":461851363,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ2MTg1MTM2Mw==","user":{"login":"mosra","id":344828,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDgyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/344828?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosra","html_url":"https://github.com/